WEBVTT

00:10:27.283 --> 00:10:30.459
Sabem que podem administrar la pesca de manera sostenible.

00:10:30.459 --> 00:10:32.101
Sabem que podem produïr

00:10:32.101 --> 00:10:35.870
menjar sa per a cents de milions de persones

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.115
que no necessita terres, no fa servir gaire aigua,

00:10:38.115 --> 00:10:39.300
té una petita petjada de carboni,

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:41.102
i és cost efectiu.

00:10:41.102 --> 00:10:43.090
Sabem que salvar els oceans

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.673
pot alimentar al món,

00:10:44.673 --> 00:10:47.060
i hem de començar ara mateix.

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:49.817
(Aplaudiments)

00:10:49.817 --> 00:10:53.525
Gràcies. (Aplaudiments)